{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionConcurrentConversionsHelpText::fr","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"fr","newTarget":"Nombre de conversions M4B que Chaptarr peut exécuter simultanément. La plupart des utilisateurs devraient conserver la valeur 1 ; des valeurs plus élevées sollicitent davantage le CPU et peuvent ralentir chaque conversion.","newTargetSha256":"78089acfca5e1bdc1720545c920ebbb072faecd01c2720957a7d31af46ba65b1","oldTarget":"Nombre de conversions M4B que Chaptarr peut exécuter simultanément. La plupart des utilisateurs doivent conserver cette valeur à 1 ; des valeurs plus élevées utilisent plus de processeur et peuvent ralentir chaque conversion.","oldTargetSha256":"dd9ed95d6660e060b8b83c45e8b53e28d19feee52e62bb79e3bbadeeac60b812","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionConcurrentConversionsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":169,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/fr.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionConcurrentConversionsHelpText::hi","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"hi","newTarget":"यह Chaptarr द्वारा एक साथ चलाए जा सकने वाले M4B रूपांतरणों की संख्या है। अधिकांश उपयोगकर्ताओं को इसे 1 पर रखना चाहिए; अधिक मान अधिक CPU का उपयोग करते हैं और हर रूपांतरण को धीमा कर सकते हैं।","newTargetSha256":"8be9133bf49bd0336cf997beec4c3116d6738fe235a939ecf106973a871960f0","oldTarget":"M4B रूपांतरणों की संख्या Chaptarr उसी समय चल सकता है। अधिकांश उपयोगकर्ताओं को इसे 1 पर रखना चाहिए; उच्च मूल्य अधिक सीपीयू का उपयोग करते हैं और प्रत्येक रूपांतरण को धीमा कर सकते हैं।","oldTargetSha256":"806c989b117b86b7d8889836ca1689934e710a8649def1518ba65f9bcc418a7b","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionConcurrentConversionsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":169,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/hi.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionMaxBitrateHelpText::es","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"es","newTarget":"Tasa de bits máxima de salida preferida. Chaptarr no codificará por encima de este valor y, cuando la opción para no aumentar la tasa de bits esté activada, tampoco elevará la tasa de bits de las fuentes que la tengan más baja.","newTargetSha256":"f766c151bbef6d370ebaa367b9fc1c148039127fbf659b486eba0acf69cc0553","oldTarget":"Tasa de bits de salida máxima preferida. Chaptarr no codificará por encima de este valor y no aumentará la tasa de bits de las fuentes de menor calidad cuando la opción de no aumentar esté activada.","oldTargetSha256":"0e40dc8d157733e50be188fcf810f065d7ae6f085ec233a77b582a20a01d3aec","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionMaxBitrateHelpText","sourceOrdinal":170,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/es.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText::ar","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"ar","newTarget":"الحد الأقصى لعدد أنوية وحدة المعالجة المركزية (CPU) التي يمكن لـ Chaptarr استخدامها لتحويل الكتب الصوتية. قد تُنهي القيم الأعلى عمليات التحويل الكبيرة متعددة الملفات بسرعة أكبر، لكنها قد تزيد العبء على بقية النظام.","newTargetSha256":"017a6f272efd06a8a258c62770176c14e5afa6edbb7458dde1824656bb7d0f24","oldTarget":"الحد الأقصى لنوى وحدة المعالجة المركزية التي يمكن لـ Chaptarr استخدامها لتحويل الكتب الصوتية. يمكن للقيم الأعلى إنهاء التحويلات الكبيرة متعددة الملفات بشكل أسرع، ولكن قد تجعل بقية النظام أكثر انشغالاً.","oldTargetSha256":"87a6e85d745f69c398de9189f581856f4e4cffc942b8848bdd5217091e7183c0","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":171,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/ar.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText::de","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"de","newTarget":"Maximale Anzahl an CPU-Kernen, die Chaptarr für die Hörbuchkonvertierung verwenden darf. Höhere Werte können große Konvertierungen mit mehreren Dateien schneller abschließen, können aber den Rest des Systems stärker auslasten.","newTargetSha256":"79ea7d01b7089d94bacd7cdc73975773146121cd98155bf115f965c6a8e78fb3","oldTarget":"Maximale Anzahl an CPU-Kernen, die Chaptarr für die Audiobuchkonvertierung verwenden darf. Höhere Werte können große Multi-Datei-Konvertierungen schneller abschließen, können aber dazu führen, dass der Rest des Systems ausgelasteter wirkt.","oldTargetSha256":"cd4376b55fb65f31108912335843edaa307450d38329ceeae52d84ea8bd7a25b","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":171,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/de.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText::es","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"es","newTarget":"Número máximo de núcleos de CPU que Chaptarr puede usar para convertir audiolibros. Los valores más altos pueden acelerar conversiones grandes con varios archivos, pero también pueden aumentar la carga del resto del sistema.","newTargetSha256":"c3e2df64e955f89d89e48ef5cab8b911ef1a9ebd4f2d6b8ed5beb22c8487e4ab","oldTarget":"Los núcleos de CPU máximos que Chaptarr puede utilizar para la conversión de audiolibros. Los valores más altos pueden terminar grandes conversiones de varios archivos más rápido, pero pueden hacer que el resto del sistema se sienta más ocupado.","oldTargetSha256":"b93d5758d8cec6338d00f326f0fe40d31cce344f94e9ec17b037ed9197534611","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":171,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/es.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText::hi","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"hi","newTarget":"अधिकतम CPU कोर जिनका उपयोग Chaptarr ऑडियोबुक रूपांतरण के लिए कर सकता है। अधिक मान बड़ी, कई-फ़ाइल वाली रूपांतरण प्रक्रियाएँ तेज़ी से पूरी कर सकते हैं, लेकिन सिस्टम के बाकी हिस्से पर अधिक भार डाल सकते हैं।","newTargetSha256":"b8ba36e05f2c67ba5287ebab195495b5b73cb5d6c1e3ea8fe8d8ba3e5a55f6c1","oldTarget":"अधिकतम CPU कोर Chaptarr ऑडियोबुक रूपांतरण के लिए उपयोग कर सकते हैं। उच्च मान बड़े बहु-फ़ाइल रूपांतरण को तेजी से समाप्त कर सकते हैं, लेकिन सिस्टम के बाकी हिस्सों को व्यस्त महसूस कर सकते हैं।","oldTargetSha256":"06ce419baa2c0d9be6c46e5a344735c6baa11f187d89ac5c28c84f645a300bff","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":171,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/hi.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
{"cellId":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText::vi","headBefore":"243f17465cc95fe84f16e17767db04a4a97ad040","locale":"vi","newTarget":"Số lõi CPU tối đa mà Chaptarr có thể dùng để chuyển đổi sách nói. Giá trị cao hơn có thể giúp hoàn tất nhanh hơn các lượt chuyển đổi lớn gồm nhiều tệp, nhưng cũng có thể làm phần còn lại của hệ thống chịu tải nặng hơn.","newTargetSha256":"2ab0620161c5ad33fda301fd2527df608d3bd2d7a696531ab7e26ce0f2ae52a4","oldTarget":"Các lõi CPU tối đa Chaptarr có thể dùng để chuyển đổi sách âm thanh. Giá trị cao hơn có thể hoàn thành chuyển đổi lớn nhanh hơn, nhưng có thể làm phần còn lại của hệ thống cảm thấy bận rộn hơn.","oldTargetSha256":"434848491f5a6f772c2a43c2b202196428a2bec61b6055b4553acf1c652b1a2c","readback":"PASS","sourceKey":"AudiobookConversionMaxCpuThreadsHelpText","sourceOrdinal":171,"targetFile":"src/NzbDrone.Core/Localization/Core/vi.json","treeBefore":"25e7bd0f3adf871b9030081ebc7c49a28213c50f"}
